## 5. Five Journey Calculation

The five journeys are calculated as follows:

1. Inner Zone, off-peak = ₹10
2. Middle Zone, peak = ₹20 + 20% = ₹24
3. Outer Zone, off-peak = ₹30
4. Inner Zone, peak = ₹10 + 20% = ₹12
5. Middle Zone, off-peak = ₹20

**Total = ₹10 + ₹24 + ₹30 + ₹12 + ₹20 = ₹96.**

